#. Tag: title
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "When An Application Will Not Open"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes when you start an application, it does not open the expected window. "
"Here are some questions to answer and steps to help you figure out what is "
"wrong."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Did the application ever start, when launched in the same manner?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If it did, for instance you have clicked an icon on your desktop that "
"previously worked, then it is unlikely to be a problem with the launcher "
"itself."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If, however, you normally start your application from an icon on &kicker; and "
"this time started it with a desktop icon, then it could simply be that the "
"launcher itself is wrong."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "But I can see the launch notification spinning cursor and taskbar entry."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: troubleshooting-no-open.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Foo</para>"
msgstr ""

